00:48:20.610 --> 00:48:39.830
David Bovill: the work that we do for Hitchhikers, and that'll be publishing and creating guides, so we're particularly interested in finding people who are interested in working on media, on software, on the technology, on the writing for guides, and on the community building and outreach around guides and guidance.

